<section class="panel bounty-confirm"><h2 class="profile-section-heading">Review contract</h2><p>Place a bounty on <a class="player-link" href="/game/players/<%= bountyQuote.targetId %>"><%= bountyQuote.targetName %></a> · Level <%= bountyQuote.targetLevel??'–' %>.</p>
<dl class="profile-gold-flow"><div><dt>Escrowed bounty</dt><dd class="gold"><%= bountyQuote.amount.toLocaleString('en') %> gold</dd></div><div><dt>Nonrefundable listing fee</dt><dd><%= bountyQuote.fee.toLocaleString('en') %> gold</dd></div><div><dt>Total charged on confirmation</dt><dd class="gold"><%= bountyQuote.total.toLocaleString('en') %> gold</dd></div></dl>
<p class="compact-help">Only an eligible finishing attacker who reduces the target to 0 Health receives the bounty and one kill. You cannot claim your own contract. The bounty expires after 24 hours; expiration refunds the entire escrowed bounty, retaining only the fee above. Cancel after one hour.</p>
<%- include('partials/bounty-quotas',{quota:bountyQuote.quotas??null}) %>
<p class="compact-help">One active contract per target. Rolling 24-hour limits: <%= bountyRules.sponsorTargetDailyLimit %> placements by the same sponsor on the same target; <%= bountyRules.targetDailyLimit %> on that target across all sponsors. Reviewing does not reserve this target. Confirmation rechecks availability and your funds; a rejected placement charges nothing. A relisted target at 0 Health must recover positive Health before another attack.</p>
<form method="post" action="/game/bounties/place"><%- include('partials/command-fields') %><input type="hidden" name="targetCharacterId" value="<%= bountyQuote.targetId %>"><input type="hidden" name="amount" value="<%= bountyQuote.amount %>"><input type="hidden" name="quotedRulesetId" value="<%= bountyQuote.rulesetId %>"><button class="button button-gold" type="submit"<% if(state.gold<bountyQuote.total) { %> disabled<% } %>>Confirm bounty — <%= bountyQuote.total %> gold</button></form><% if(state.gold<bountyQuote.total) { %><p class="warning">You need <%= bountyQuote.total %> gold including the listing fee.</p><% } %><a class="text-link" href="/game/players/<%= bountyQuote.targetId %>">Back to profile ›</a></section>
